# cargo-mobile / the Android build symlinks the per-ABI Rust cdylib into
# app/src/main/jniLibs/<abi>/libapp_lib.so — a multi-MB build artifact. The sibling
# app/.gitignore already has `/src/main/jniLibs/**/*.so`, so this is belt-and-braces
# for a .so that lands anywhere else under gen/android (and for the case where
# app/.gitignore is regenerated by `tauri android init`).
*.so
app/src/main/jniLibs/